<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Testing on cesun.life</title><link>https://example.org/tags/testing/</link><description>Recent content in Testing on cesun.life</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:18:23 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://example.org/tags/testing/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>JUnit 5 Architecture, Maven Setup, and JUnit 4 Migration</title><link>https://example.org/junit-5/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:18:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://example.org/junit-5/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;JUnit 5 separates the API used to write tests from the infrastructure that
discovers and executes them. The separation lets Maven, IDEs, and custom
launchers run several test models through one interface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The examples target JUnit 5.13.4. JUnit 6 retains the same architecture, but a
project that must remain on JUnit 5 should use the
&lt;a href="https://docs.junit.org/5.13.4/user-guide/"&gt;versioned JUnit 5 documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="platform-jupiter-and-vintage"&gt;
 Platform, Jupiter, and Vintage
 &lt;a href="#platform-jupiter-and-vintage" class="heading-anchor"&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;#&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;JUnit 5 consists of three components:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mockito without and with JUnit 5</title><link>https://example.org/mockito/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:18:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://example.org/mockito/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Mockito creates test doubles for Java interfaces and classes. Its core API
does not depend on JUnit: a program can create a mock, configure behavior,
invoke code, and verify interactions from an ordinary &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; method. JUnit
integration adds test discovery and automatic mock lifecycle management rather
than basic mocking capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="minimal-maven-project-without-junit"&gt;
 Minimal Maven Project Without JUnit
 &lt;a href="#minimal-maven-project-without-junit" class="heading-anchor"&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;#&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Put the demonstration under &lt;code&gt;src/test/java&lt;/code&gt; because Mockito has test scope:&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;div class="jose-wrapper"&gt;
 &lt;div class="jose-tools"&gt; &lt;span&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;

 &lt;div class="jose-inner"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;mockito-hello/
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;├── pom.xml
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;└── src/test/java/com/example/MockitoHello.java&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="jose-wrapper"&gt;
 &lt;div class="jose-tools"&gt; &lt;span&gt;xml&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;

 &lt;div class="jose-inner"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;project&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;xmlns=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;xmlns:xsi=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;xsi:schemaLocation=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt; https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;modelVersion&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;4.0.0&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/modelVersion&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;com.example&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;mockito-hello&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;1.0-SNAPSHOT&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;properties&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;maven.compiler.release&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;17&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/maven.compiler.release&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;mockito.version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;5.23.0&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/mockito.version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/properties&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;dependencies&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;dependency&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;org.mockito&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;mockito-core&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;${mockito.version}&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;scope&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;test&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/scope&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/dependency&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/dependencies&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;/project&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="jose-wrapper"&gt;
 &lt;div class="jose-tools"&gt; &lt;span&gt;java&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;

 &lt;div class="jose-inner"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; com.example;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import static&lt;/span&gt; org.mockito.Mockito.mock;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import static&lt;/span&gt; org.mockito.Mockito.verify;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import static&lt;/span&gt; org.mockito.Mockito.when;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;interface&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Greeter&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; String &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;greet&lt;/span&gt;(String name);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;final&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;MockitoHello&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;static&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;(String&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt; args) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; Greeter greeter &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; mock(Greeter.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; when(greeter.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;greet&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Ada&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)).&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;thenReturn&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Hello, Ada&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; String actual &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; greeter.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;greet&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Ada&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Hello, Ada&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;equals&lt;/span&gt;(actual)) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;throw&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; AssertionError(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;unexpected result: &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; actual);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; verify(greeter).&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;greet&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Ada&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compile the test class and invoke it with the Maven Exec Plugin:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Testing Spring Boot REST APIs</title><link>https://example.org/testing-spring-boot-rest-apis/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:18:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://example.org/testing-spring-boot-rest-apis/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Testing a Spring Boot REST API requires several scopes because a direct Java
call, a simulated MVC request, and a request through a live server exercise
different failure boundaries. A useful test suite places most behavior checks
below the Spring context, then adds narrower web slices and a smaller number
of full-application tests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The dependency examples target Spring Boot 3.x because its test starter uses
JUnit 5. Spring Boot 4 manages JUnit 6; Jupiter concepts remain, but package
names for several Boot test annotations changed.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Testing C and C++ Programs</title><link>https://example.org/cpp-testing/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Oct 2022 10:04:22 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://example.org/cpp-testing/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;C and C++ tests are executable programs whose status must affect the build and CI result. A framework can improve assertions and reporting, but a test executable with a dedicated &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; and deterministic dependencies is sufficient when integrated with the project&amp;rsquo;s test runner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="build-tests-as-first-class-targets"&gt;
 Build Tests as First-Class Targets
 &lt;a href="#build-tests-as-first-class-targets" class="heading-anchor"&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;#&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compile test targets separately from production binaries and link them against the production library. Register every executable with the existing test runner, such as CTest, Meson, or Automake &lt;code&gt;TESTS&lt;/code&gt;, so a nonzero exit status fails CI.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>